&lt;p&gt;Q1: What will we teach in the future?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Q2: How will we teach?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Creation experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s not a toy of revolution, but a revolution of toy.&lt;/p&gt;
