&lt;p&gt;Teacher’s Behavioral Norms&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>句法思维导图</title><link>https://nzw025.top/xuehai/xuexi/jufa/</link><pubDate>Wed, 25 Feb 2026 21:16:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://nzw025.top/xuehai/xuexi/jufa/</guid><description>&lt;DIV class="full-width" style="POSITION: relative; WIDTH: 1600px; TOP: 100px; LEFT: -250px"&gt;&lt;IFRAME height=900 marginHeight=0 src="https://NZW025.github.io/html/english/ablessq.html" frameBorder=0 width=1600 marginWidth=0 scrolling=no&gt;&lt;/IFRAME&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description></item><item><title>生而为人，抱歉</title><link>https://nzw025.top/jilu/riji/baoqian/</link><pubDate>Wed, 25 Feb 2026 21:16:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://nzw025.top/jilu/riji/baoqian/</guid><description>&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;对于这个世界，不知怎么热爱。热闹的宴席，也不能捂暖内心的苍凉。越来越与情感隔缘，渴望和失望接踵而至，羡慕那些对世界还满腔热情的人儿，即便跌得遍体鳞伤，仍然渴望着爱与被爱。也许我读的书太少，见识太浅薄。该静下心来，多看书，多感知这个世界，看看除了等价交换，是否余留那么一点纯粹得让我为之欣喜若狂的东西。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>写作</title><link>https://nzw025.top/xuehai/xiezuo/dome/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Feb 2026 21:15:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://nzw025.top/xuehai/xiezuo/dome/</guid><description/></item><item><title>当你老了</title><link>https://nzw025.top/yule/yinhua/dangnilaole/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Feb 2026 21:15:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://nzw025.top/yule/yinhua/dangnilaole/</guid><description/></item><item><title>生活</title><link>https://nzw025.top/jilu/shenghuo/dome/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Feb 2026 21:15:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://nzw025.top/jilu/shenghuo/dome/</guid><description/></item><item><title>词汇</title><link>https://nzw025.top/xuehai/cihui/dome/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Feb 2026 21:15:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://nzw025.top/xuehai/cihui/dome/</guid><description/></item><item><title>语法</title><link>https://nzw025.top/xuehai/yufa/dome/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Feb 2026 21:15:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://nzw025.top/xuehai/yufa/dome/</guid><description/></item><item><title>语音</title><link>https://nzw025.top/xuehai/yuyin/dome/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Feb 2026 21:15:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://nzw025.top/xuehai/yuyin/dome/</guid><description/></item><item><title>平安喜乐 得偿所愿</title><link>https://nzw025.top/yule/yinhua/paxl/</link><pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2025 21:03:27 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://nzw025.top/yule/yinhua/paxl/</guid><description>&lt;!-- 核心修复：删除多余的 HTML 骨架（Hugo 会自动生成 html/head/body） --&gt;
